<title>USA: Hadco gets 97 pct of Zycon.</title>
<headline>Hadco gets 97 pct of Zycon.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, N.H. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hadco Corp said Friday that its wholly-owned subsidiary, Hadco Acquisition Corp, completed its tender offer for all outstanding shares of Zycon Corp at $18 per share, and 97 percent of all outstanding shares had been validly tendered.  </p>
<p>Hadco also said in a release that the merger of Hadco Acquisition Corp into Zycon was completed, making Zycon a wholly-owned subsidiary of Hadco.</p>
</text>
